  "doc.appendix.pathsNoteText": "The folder name is the app identifier <code>com.mingo.datanexa</code>, which does not change with the interface language. Database passwords are not in these files; they live in the system keychain under the same identifier.",
  "doc.appendix.pathsNoteTitle": "Directory name comes from the app identifier",
  "doc.appendix.pathsP": "Configuration, audit, and access-control databases live in the config directory, while drivers, the Maven cache, the Java runtime, and debug logs live in the data directory. On macOS and Windows both are the same folder; on Linux they differ. “Settings → Storage & performance → Open data directory” opens the data directory directly.",
